{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50322","headline":"除夜 · 佚名","name":"除夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荒城何独泪澘然，闻说今宵（原作「霄」）是改年。\n亲故睽携长已矣，幽缧寂寞镇愁煎。\n更深肠绝谁人念，夜永心伤空自怜。\n爲恨漂零无计力，空知日夕仰穹天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50322.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50322","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}